OL,3,GNEWSAQueen Mother started Christmas
OL,4,Atradition for sailors' orphans
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe economy of Hull was built on the
OL,7,Fsea, but prosperity came at a cost.
OL,8,FOver the centuries, thousands of
OL,9,Fseafarers lost their lives and their
OL,10,Fchildren were often left orphaned.
OL,12,FFor more than 200 years, the Sailors'
OL,13,FChildren's Society has cared for those
OL,14,Fyoung people, winning support not only
OL,15,Ffrom the people of Hull, but from
OL,16,Finfluential patrons around the country,
OL,17,Fincluding members of the Royal Family.
OL,23,APub: 25-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
