OL,3,GNEWSAQueen Mother started Christmas
OL,4,Atradition for sailors' orphans
OL,5,
OL,6,FDiana, Princess of Wales, Princess
OL,7,FMargaret and Queen Elizabeth the Queen
OL,8,FMother, were among royal visitors to
OL,9,Fthe charity's homes for orphans in
OL,10,FCottingham Road during the 20th
OL,11,FCentury, as the Hidden East Yorkshire
OL,12,Fpodcast has been hearing.
OL,14,FThe Queen Mother became a patron of the
OL,15,Fcharity in 1935 and never forgot the
OL,16,Fchildren, according to Mary Rose "Mo"
OL,17,FBarker, a former chairwoman of the
OL,18,Fsociety.
